{"text": "High above the city stood the statue of the Happy Prince, covered in gold, with sapphire eyes. One night, a little swallow rested at his feet, and a tear fell on him. The Prince was crying. 'I can see all the sadness of my city,' he said. 'Please, take my ruby to a poor family.' Every day, the swallow took a leaf of gold to the poor, and the children smiled again. Winter came. The statue was grey now, and the tired swallow kissed the Prince's hand. But the Prince and the swallow had the most beautiful hearts in the whole city.", "words": [[0.5, 0.7], [0.74, 1.0], [1.04, 1.12], [1.2, 1.48], [1.6, 1.8], [1.82, 1.9], [1.94, 2.4], [2.46, 2.52], [2.54, 2.62], [2.68, 2.88], [2.98, 3.34], [3.82, 4.12], [4.14, 4.24], [4.32, 4.7], [4.78, 4.9], [4.96, 5.36], [5.46, 5.82], [7.38, 7.5], [7.58, 7.84], [7.92, 7.94], [8.0, 8.22], [8.34, 8.72], [8.82, 9.16], [9.18, 9.26], [9.28, 9.38], [9.46, 9.76], [10.06, 10.14], [10.18, 10.2], [10.28, 10.52], [10.66, 10.86], [10.9, 10.98], [11.04, 11.2], [11.78, 11.86], [11.9, 12.22], [12.26, 12.38], [12.44, 12.9], [12.98, 14.46], [14.52, 14.62], [14.72, 14.84], [14.96, 15.06], [15.1, 15.18], [15.28, 15.68], [15.72, 15.78], [15.84, 15.96], [16.08, 16.6], [16.66, 16.72], [16.82, 17.08], [17.24, 18.1], [18.18, 18.38], [18.44, 18.54], [18.66, 18.9], [18.98, 19.04], [19.1, 19.12], [19.18, 19.36], [19.44, 20.14], [21.32, 21.56], [21.62, 21.86], [21.98, 22.06], [22.14, 22.5], [22.6, 22.74], [22.78, 22.8], [22.86, 23.04], [23.08, 23.14], [23.22, 23.54], [23.6, 23.64], [23.68, 23.76], [23.8, 24.04], [24.6, 24.68], [24.7, 24.76], [24.82, 25.22], [25.36, 25.76], [25.8, 26.1], [27.62, 27.9], [27.96, 28.32], [28.66, 28.74], [28.8, 29.24], [29.28, 29.38], [29.44, 29.64], [29.74, 29.94], [30.04, 30.1], [30.12, 30.2], [30.24, 30.56], [30.62, 30.94], [31.06, 31.32], [31.34, 31.42], [31.44, 31.86], [31.94, 32.28], [33.72, 33.82], [33.86, 33.94], [34.0, 34.38], [34.42, 34.52], [34.54, 34.6], [34.66, 35.06], [35.32, 35.44], [35.46, 35.54], [35.58, 35.78]